Priority: optional
Depends: systemd
Description: stand-in for the product package in the sysupdate verification
 Laid out the way a Debian package usually is: a service, a system user, a
 conffile in /etc and a postinst. verify.sh turns it into a system extension
 to see which of these survive (docs/research/sysupdate-image-verification.md).
